ra bandwidth to transmit it. Meantime, watermarking is an information hiding sub-discipline that embeds some information into host image. In this paper a joined digital signature and digital watermarking scheme for image authentication is proposed which is based on signature generation method purposed by [4] and combined DWT-DCT watermark embedding procedure [3]. The scheme extracts signature from the original image and embeds them back into the image as watermark which leads to avoiding additional signature file.","authors":[{"id":"a5069350051","name":"Seyed Mohammad Mousavi","orcid":"0000-0002-7366-8808","institution_ids":[]}],"institution_ids":[],"venue":null,"task_tags":["digital_watermarking"],"contribution_type":"method","review_status":"verified","doi":"","arxiv_id":"","openalex_id":"W2558161917","semantic_scholar_id":"","primary_url":"http://www.ijcem.org/papers052013/ijcem_052013_08.pdf","citation_count":4,"provenance":[{"source":"openalex","source_id":"W2558161917","url":"https://openalex.org/W2558161917","query":"digital image watermarking authentication","retrieved_at":"2026-07-15T06:11:49Z"}],"notes":"快速批量核验：已有稳定来源，且现有任务标签与图像取证范围一致。"}]